  "description": "LvivFur, first known as LvivFurrence, was a furry convention held in Lviv Oblast, Ukraine. It mainly drew Ukrainian-speaking locals, with some visitors from Russia, the UK and Belgium. It followed small furmeets in Lviv in 2015 and 2016, and its first event was held July 20 to 23, 2017. Conventions were held each July through 2019, and later editions were postponed because of the COVID-19 pandemic and the situation in Ukraine.",
